"Your emails"
msgstr "samir_maric@yahoo.se"

#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "Socks"
msgstr "Socks"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid "&Enable SOCKS support"
msgstr "&Uključi podršku za SOCKS"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid ""
"Check this to enable SOCKS4 and SOCKS5 support in KDE applications and I/O "
"subsystems."
msgstr ""
"Ako ovo markirate uključićete podršku za SOCKS4 and SOCKS5 u KDE "
"programima i I/O podsistemima."

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid "SOCKS Implementation"
msgstr "SOCKS Implementacija"

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "A&uto detect"
msgstr "A&utomatska detekcija"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"If you select Autodetect, then KDE will automatically search for an "
"implementation of SOCKS on your computer."
msgstr ""
"Ako izaberete auto-detekciju KDE će automatski tražit implementaciju "
"SOCKS-a na vašem kompjuteru."

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid "&NEC SOCKS"
msgstr "&NEC SOCKS"

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid "This will force KDE to use NEC SOCKS if it can be found."
msgstr "Ovo će prisiliti KDE to koristi NEC SOCKS ako je pronađen."

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid "Use &custom library"
msgstr "Koristi &prilagođenu biblioteku"

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid ""
"Select custom if you wish to use an unlisted SOCKS library. Please note that "
"this may not always work as it depends on the API of the library which you "
"specify (below)."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite prilagođenu ako želite koristiti SOCKS biblioteku koja nije u "
"listi. Molim vas da obratite pažnju da ovo možda neće uvijek raditi "
"pošto ovisi o API-ju biblioteke koju ste naveli (dole)."

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid "&Path:"
msgstr "&Putanja:"

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "Enter the path to an unsupported SOCKS library."
msgstr "Unesite putanju do nepodržane SOCKS biblioteke."

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid "&Dante"
msgstr "&Dante"

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "This will force KDE to use Dante if it can be found."
msgstr "Ovo će prisiliti KDE da koristi Dante, ako se može naći."

#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "Additional Library Search Paths"
msgstr "Dodatne putanje za traženje biblioteka"

#: rc.cpp:16
msgid ""
"Here you can specify additional directories to search for the SOCKS "
"libraries. /usr/lib, /usr/local/lib, /usr/local/socks5/lib and "
"/opt/socks5/lib are already searched by default."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete navesti dodatne direktorije za traženje SOCKS biblioteka. "
"/usr/lib, /usr/local/lib, /usr/local/socks5/lib i /opt/socks5/ će biti "
"pretražene po default-u."

#: rc.cpp:17
msgid "Path"
msgstr "Putanja"

#: rc.cpp:18
msgid "This is the list of additional paths that will be searched."
msgstr "Ovo je lista dodatnih putanja koje će biti pretražene."

#: rc.cpp:19
msgid "&Add"
msgstr "Dod&aj"

#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "&Test"
msgstr "&Test"

#: rc.cpp:22
msgid "Click here to test SOCKS support."
msgstr "Pritisnite ovdje da biste testirali podršku za SOCKS."

#: socks.cpp:88
msgid "These changes will only apply to newly started applications."
msgstr "Promjene će biti primjenjene samo za nanovo pokrenute programe."

#: socks.cpp:90 socks.cpp:123 socks.cpp:128
msgid "SOCKS Support"
msgstr "SOCKS podrška"

#: socks.cpp:122
msgid "Success! SOCKS was found and initialized."
msgstr "Uspjeh! SOCKS je pronađen i pokrenut."

#: socks.cpp:127
msgid "SOCKS could not be loaded."
msgstr "SOCKS nije mogao biti učitan."

#: socks.cpp:266
msgid ""
"<h1>SOCKS</h1>"
"<p>This module allows you to configure KDE support for a SOCKS server or "
"proxy.</p>"
"<p>SOCKS is a protocol to traverse firewalls as described in <a "
"href=\"http://rfc.net/rfc1928.html\">RFC 1928</a>. "
"<p>"
"If you have no idea what this is and if your system administrator doesn't "
"tell you to use it, leave it disabled.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>SOCKS</h1>"
"<p>U ovom modulu možete podesiti KDE podršku za SOCKS server ili "
"posrednik.</p>"
"<p>SOCKS je protocol za prolaz kroz firewall-e kao što je opisano u <a "
"href=\"http://rfc.net/rfc1928.html\">RFC 1928</a>. "
"<p>Ako ne znate šta je ovo i ako vam vaš administrator sistema nije rekao "
"da koristite SOCKS, ostavite ovo isključeno.</p>"

